# GraphQL / SDK

```ts
import { storefrontClient, cachePresets, withLocale } from '@/lib/storefront';
import { getProduct, getCatalogProducts } from '@finqu/storefront-sdk/server';

const { product } = await getProduct(storefrontClient, { id });
```

- Server: `storefrontClient` + `FINQU_SECRET_KEY`. Client: hooks + `NEXT_PUBLIC_FINQU_PUBLIC_KEY`.
- Cache: `cachePresets.static` (routes/menus), `.products` (catalog), `.dynamic` (cart/auth). Always `withLocale`.
- Deduplicate per request with `React.cache()` (see `getResourceByPath`).
- Custom operations: add typed documents in `lib/queries/`, re-export from `lib/queries/index.ts`.
- Mutations must surface `userErrors`. Do not swallow them.
- Types come from `@finqu/storefront-types`, not hand-rolled duplicates.
